  <item>
    <title>🕺 12 跳舞：从古巴到多米尼加，阿康带你一起走进拉丁社交舞蹈 - Salsa / Bachata / Kizomba</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685548432a38b4d979aca8ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685548432a38b4d979aca8ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Jun 2025 11:45:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>参加7个国际舞蹈节、和500位中外美女搭手跳舞、上台表演和Jack &amp; Jill比赛…… 所有这些事情，好像都和我之前的人设毫不搭嘎。但是，奈何跳舞已经慢慢成为了我的个人标签，越跳越帅，越跳越享受，越跳越开心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，让我们说说：我的跳舞经历；关于拉美舞蹈的一些知识普及，也会带你听听不同舞种音乐的区别；当然还会给你分享一些有意思的故事（有你想听的那种）；我学舞的动机与收获；以及对于一些外界误解和偏见的个人观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对，你肯定会喜欢这一期的的哈哈哈！😁</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>跳舞、社交舞蹈、拉丁舞蹈、拉美舞蹈、Salsa、Bachata、Kizomba、Zouk、萨尔萨、骚莎、巴恰塔、基宗巴、国标、探戈、摇摆舞、舞蹈节、Jack &amp; Jill</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）我的跳舞经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 2014年接触古巴Salsa、2024年重学Bachata</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 7个国际舞蹈节，和500位美女搭手跳舞</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）拉丁社交舞 - 知识普及</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 单人舞、编舞、摇摆舞、国标拉丁、探戈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> Salsa：起源于古巴的超级辣酱 🇨🇺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> Bachata：风靡全球的多米尼加舞步 🇩🇴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> Kizomba：非洲探戈，性感神秘 🇦🇴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> Zouk：空灵而神性，让人沉醉 🇧🇷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 各类舞种的比较，总有你喜欢的菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 听友的各类问题，我来解答啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）一些有意思的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">26:47</a> 舞蹈节：上课、舞会、训练营、表演、比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> 不仅仅是舞蹈，而是渗透在生活中的文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 你敢相信，我学舞8个月都不敢去舞会！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> 美女！美女！美女都是纸老虎！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 社交舞蹈是一种语言，掌握它跳遍全世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a> 鼓舞人的故事：小个子、断指姑娘、姐姐与阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>4）跳舞前后的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2487">41:27</a> 动机：抗抑郁、健康、社交、泡妞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 收获：成就感、帅气、自信、国际化视野、归属感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">51:14</a> 人生视角：享受当下、长期主义、自我突破、传递能量</span></p><span></span><p><span>5）社会误解、偏见和我的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3269">54:29</a> 大家都应该认识一下：深圳的西西里刘总</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a> 关于偏见的回应：纸醉金迷？昼夜颠倒？“妻离子散舞”？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 示例：Que Bueno Baila Usted, by Oscar D Leon</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bacahta 示例：Darte un Beso, by Prince Royce</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kizomba 示例：Mil Pesos, by SOHA</span></p><span></span><p><span>Zouk 示例：Zouk x Love x Guitar x Chill</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to Sam 哥 aka. 西西里刘总.</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂🏻 微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6711093fbf1a52cfd4657370/lmIAIciHIpoo-7ikCAGRHKW246ve.m4a" length="91688628" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaDPyb_C6J0R_mbm6WAEj1V6mtZ.png"/>
