  <item>
    <title>🤔​​​​ 10 思考日 Think Day：认真赶路，也要抬头看天，不如闭关一天，放飞一下自我吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682dbabd457b22ce0dd633fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682dbabd457b22ce0dd633fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 May 2025 11:36:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一整天不用手机，回归到不联网的生活，是种什么感觉？兴奋、忐忑、新奇、还是收获满满？把自己完全放空，身体和心理上都与世隔绝，用整整一天的时间去思考自己的人生重要问题，天马行空，放飞自我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我将把思考日 Think Day 的概念与你分享，也和你唠一唠我自己的思考日的神奇体验与感悟。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>思考日、Think Day、人生的五种财富、心智财富、空间、成长、抬头看天、战略思考、内观禅修、Vipassana、抬头看天、知行合一、人生战略、优先级</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）什么是思考日 Think Day？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 来源于《The 5 Types of Wealth》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 比尔盖茨 Bill Gates 的思考周</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 定义、目标、工具和8个启发性问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）我的体验与收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 准备：忐忑、兴奋、差点破功！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 觉察到情绪的变化，心情过山车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 可爱的观察，与天马行空的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 必要的Action Plan，帮助我做出改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）我的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 抬头看天：总有更加重要的大问题，需要我们去面对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 知行合一：对抗人性的修炼，让自己变得更好</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖 参考材料/延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《The Five Types of Wealth》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to 乔乔, 小Kathy &amp; Michael 冯.</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂🏻 微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6711093fbf1a52cfd4657370/lkXVwNmpA0rpHyCVG-KYF0bRifFq.m4a" length="52641464" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaDPyb_C6J0R_mbm6WAEj1V6mtZ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>🏖️ 09 旅居：旅行在左，生活在右，工作在沙滩中间乐悠悠（海风揉~浪里游~晒成藕~不想走！）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681de58c24f8559346c36b1a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681de58c24f8559346c36b1a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 May 2025 11:23:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>被炒的很火的旅居，到底是个什么玩意？数字游民听起来很酷，那是一种临时状态还是一种可持续的生活方式？在越南岘港旅居的这一两个月，让我切身实地得到了一些更加深刻的理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>该如何定义旅居？为什么要旅居？我如何做出旅居这个决定？确定旅居地点的整个过程；旅居面对到的各种问题；以及我的见闻和感受；还有，我会帮你参考一下，你适不适合旅居？如果要旅居，需要做哪些准备工作？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我将详细和你分享一下旅居这个话题的个人看法。希望你能喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>旅居、数字游民、Digital Nomad、旅行、居住、长居、候鸟、地理套利、远程工作、在线工作、移动的咖啡厅、退休</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）关于旅居的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 定义旅居：强调​​流动性、临时性和深度体验​​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 把旅行、旅居、长居放在一个表上来对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 为什么要旅居：体验多样性、数字游民、经济理性的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）我这次旅居的前后经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 我是如何做出旅居决定的：符合我当下的人生目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> 选择旅居地点：🇨🇳🇹🇭🇷🇸🇪🇸🇰🇿🇨🇴🇻🇳，到底选哪个呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">23:27</a> 适应旅居生活：融入、适应、发展与探索</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）旅居的见闻与感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 整个城市的咖啡厅和沙滩都是你的办公室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a> 在其他地方生活和游牧，可能是一种持续的生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a> 注重心灵的成长，只拎着一个行李箱走天下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2047">34:07</a> 候鸟迁徙，在适合的季节去适合的地方去居住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> 地理套利，是切切实实存在的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 旅居，让我打破对于单一生活模式的盲从</span></p><span></span><p><span>4）旅居是否适合你？要做什么准备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a> 想清楚，旅居对你来说到底意味着什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 仔细衡量一下自己的性格与价值观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2494">41:34</a> 积累旅行与生活的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 创造线上工作，或者在当地工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 英语还是得学好，走遍天下都不怕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 20岁需要你的勇气，30岁需要你的智慧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to Anar, Nadiya, Daniya and all the digital nomads that I met from Kazakhstan 🇰🇿.</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂🏻 微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
