  <item>
    <title>💎 07 财富新定义：人生的五种财富 - 《The 5 Types of Wealth》读后感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67da51bbdd11f9c8c19b4afd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67da51bbdd11f9c8c19b4afd</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Mar 2025 05:14:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年2月发售的新书，名字听起来像碗兑了水的鸡汤，但实质是本超级好书。阅读的时候，我就立马决定做一期“读后感”，把刚刚上市发售不久的新书《The 5 Types of Wealth》（五种财富 / 财富的五种类型）分享给你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>阅读的过程中，我一次又一次被触动到，有太多的感想和收获。这也是为什么我这一次，可以噼里啪啦讲一个小时。希望这一期的播客，也可以给你带来一些启发和帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>财富自由、财富、时间财富、人际关系财富、心智财富、健康财富、金钱财富、社交、精神、身体、心理、钱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📈 参考文档</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>▶ 快来测一测：</span><a href="https://rk0al08dcn.feishu.cn/sheets/Vx8YsCJsLhM6SMtSnAYcZZT4nlb" data-url="https://rk0al08dcn.feishu.cn/sheets/Vx8YsCJsLhM6SMtSnAYcZZT4nlb"><span>【测试】财富计分板 Wealth Scoreboard</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> 财富的定义不应仅仅是金钱，财富应该由5类财富组合而成：时间财富、人际关系财富、心智财富、健康财富、金钱财富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 图书结构：大问题、反目标、三大支柱、指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）财富计分板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 默认的财富计分板：用金钱当做唯一衡量指标的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 新的财富计分板：5种财富，25道题，满分100分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 快来测测看，你有多少财富！</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）时间财富 Time Wealth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 在父母去世之前，这一辈子，还会见他们多少面？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 死亡宣言，每个星期涂圈圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 做时间的亿万富翁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 1666年，那是一个春天，有一位少年，在英格兰的农场边，干了一年~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 时间自由的终极目标</span></p><span></span><p><span>4）人际关系资源 Social Wealth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 更多的Connectedness，更少的Connected</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a> 人老之后，决定幸福感最重要的因素，就是人际关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 像锻炼身体肌肉一样，锻炼人际关系的肌肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> Bought Status vs Earned Status</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 人际关系地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 3H沟通方法：Helped 帮助、Heard 倾听、Hug 拥抱</span></p><span></span><p><span>5）心智财富 Mental Wealth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a> 不完美地活出自己的人生 &gt;&gt; 完美地去活成他人的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 日本冲绳的传统智慧：Ikigai</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 为什么要经常地、持续地思考人生目标和意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 费曼法则：你看我做播客，也是通过输出来学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 个人追求地图：天才、爱好、危险区域</span></p><span></span><p><span>6）健康财富 Physical Wealth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> 80岁的时候，我还能不能跳Bachata？一定要能啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 把自己的身体，当成一个还需要再住70年的房子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">49:21</a> 三大支柱：运动、饮食、睡眠</span></p><span></span><p><span>7）金钱财富 Financial Wealth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 最重要的问题：到底什么才是Enough？</span></p><span></span><p><span>8）总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3391">56:31</a> 一本集大成、能落地的Self-Help Book自助书</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖 参考材料/延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《The 5 Types of Wealth - A Transformative Guide to Design Your Dream Life》</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 加听友群，获得中英文阅读方法</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to my mother for her teaching of "活到老，学到老".</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂🏻 微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
