  <item>
    <title>💇🏻‍♂️ 05 长期主义、复利与习惯：Tony康老师吹着头，和你认真唠唠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b5be6505a90dfd0d878193</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b5be6505a90dfd0d878193</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Feb 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期的节目，画风突变！我们说说读书、健身、理财、冥想，跳舞，甚至慢性疾病。那它们之间到底有什么最大公约数？到底是什么东西能够让我们取得Impressive的结果？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们来认真唠唠，一个老掉牙，但是对我影响很大的思维模式：长期主义。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>长期主义、复利、习惯、纳瓦尔宝典、延迟满足、先苦后甜、系统1/系统2</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）长期主义如何深刻地改变了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 查理芒格要我养成读书的习惯，那我试试看吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 2年时间，500次的运动健身带来的是什么结果？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 当我准备放弃跳舞的那一刻，我想到...</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）几乎所有让人钦佩和羡慕的成绩，都是长期主义的努力累计之后引起的质变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 生活中所有重大的回报，都来自于复利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 量变到质变：当一位毫无训练痕迹的男生夸我身材好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 长期的坏习惯，也会导致无法逆转的质变</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）长期主义是反人性的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 收获都来自承受短期痛苦而获得的长期回报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 福布斯30 Under 30，错过风口的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 多巴胺 vs 内啡肽</span></p><span></span><p><span>4）长期主义的诀窍：养成习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">32:52</a> 一个人的Daily Routine，决定了他会成为怎样的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> 养成习惯是长期目标的底层拆解方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2207">36:47</a> 系统1 vs 系统2：从紧张流汗，到无脑开车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> 是时候告诉你为什么我是Tony康了！文末点题！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖 参考材料/延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《纳瓦尔宝典》《穷查理宝典》《凯文凯利-宝贵的人生建议》《掌控习惯》《福格行为模型》《微习惯》《思考，快与慢》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to Feng Yi.</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂🏻 微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
