  <item>
    <title>💯 04 完美主义的陷阱：用25个小时做一期播客，疯了吧！ ×「职场阴阳师」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6781f28ed6a4b57e14584709</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6781f28ed6a4b57e14584709</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jan 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期为「阿康 | FreeDive」×「</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e36ea3e99bdef7d342fffd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e36ea3e99bdef7d342fffd"><strong><span>职场阴阳师</span></strong></a><strong><span>」串台节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>完美主义是困扰我多年的个人特质，也是导致我之前陷入抑郁症的重要成因之一。多年来，它给我带来的负面影响要远远大于积极作用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是追求卓越，还是害怕失败？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是做到最好，还是拖延焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是人性的扭曲，还是... 一个需要自我接纳和调整的个人特质？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期，「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e36ea3e99bdef7d342fffd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e36ea3e99bdef7d342fffd"><span>职场阴阳师</span></a><span>」的两位主播 </span><em><span>犀利鸭Celia</span></em><span> 和 </span><em><span>伊恩Ian</span></em><span> 知道了我用25个小时做一期”完美“播客后，诚心发问：我是如何努力克服完美主义？（但是却又摆脱不了完美主义的影子的🤷🏻‍♂️）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>完美主义、害怕失败、追求卓越、抑郁、焦虑、拖延、J人、叛逆行动、注重过程、做到最好、注重细节、内耗、MBTI</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 完美主义的完美例子：录制一期播客节目需要25个有效工作小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 用车厘子等级类比划分的J人程度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 说录就录的播客：给完美主义者一点小小的震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 临时取消的录制让我气“死”了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> 完美主义是对于失败的一种失能性恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> “你们小时候是被夸聪明更多，还是被夸努力更多？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 完美主义是我抑郁症的主要成因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 越在意就越害怕失败：做播客也是我对抗完美主义的一个尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 学会课题分离：播客专家并非就一定是个流量主播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2981">49:41</a> 我在滑雪场完成了一次对完美主义的完美克服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 把“我应该”换成“我可以”以及“我想要”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3482">58:02</a> 如何成为不完美主义者：每天的一分钟Review和做一些叛逆行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3818">63:38</a> 完美主义的积极面：Strive for Excellence</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3984">66:24</a> 人生的完美主义：错过了的事情，我该回头重新去做吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4213">70:13</a> 在个人时间管理中，如何平衡完美主义与生活的松弛感？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖 参考材料/延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>哈佛大学公开课：《哈佛幸福课 / 积极心理学》 by Tal Ben-Shahar</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35390276/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35390276/"><span>《如何成为不完美主义者》by [美] 斯蒂芬·盖斯</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to 「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e36ea3e99bdef7d342fffd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/63e36ea3e99bdef7d342fffd"><span>职场阴阳师</span></a><span>」主播：犀利鸭Celia（水姐）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👂🏻 微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6711093fbf1a52cfd4657370/loCBpDhUXwzK8xvboQhVB9bH86jv.m4a" length="108713164" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaDPyb_C6J0R_mbm6WAEj1V6mtZ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>🌎 03 间隔年① 潜水插花搭车义工禅修旅行，Gap Year如何改变了我的人生轨迹？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6762427784447b1bd0c4d955</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6762427784447b1bd0c4d955</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 03:54:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>10年前的间隔年，如何改变了我的人生轨迹？</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为间隔年系列的第①期，在这里和大家分享一下，我在10年前的精彩间隔年经历。我也因此得以有机会，在旅游卫视、TEDx、AIESEC、清华北大等各大高校分享了我的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的一篇总结性文章《我的间隔年——潜水、花艺、搭车、义工、禅修和旅行》也成为了当时人人网的全网Top 1热帖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，站在10年之后，让我再次重述当年的故事，看看这一年的Gap Year是如何影响了我的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💡 关键词</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>间隔年、Gap Year、Career Break、TED、AIESEC、休学、潜水、插花、搭车、义工、禅修、旅行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📍 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）当一切开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 桌面研究10年前的自己，感慨万千</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 休学一年 —— 间隔年概要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 一切都有来由：我为什么要间隔年？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）间隔年的精彩经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 潜水：从仙本那开始，潜向全球200个国家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 插花：远赴荷兰，跟随花艺冠军学插花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 搭车：6天时间，11辆车，北京搭车去澳门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 义工：在柬埔寨的小岛上，下海潜水数海马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">29:16</a> 禅修：闭关10天，每天打坐11小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> 旅行：重要的不是去了什么地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）回顾与总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a> 生活应有的样子，让我 live to the fullest!</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Salsa 90 BPM by TheLastOneOnEarth -- </span><a href="https://freesound.org/s/698660/" data-url="https://freesound.org/s/698660/"><span>freesound.org</span></a><span> -- License: Attribution 4.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📖 参考材料/延伸阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.le.com/ptv/vplay/2266909.html" data-url="https://www.le.com/ptv/vplay/2266909.html"><span>旅游卫视：《看今天》旅行新主张，边打工边旅行</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>TEDxTHU 清华演讲：《间隔年是修行》</span></p><span></span><p><span>人人网：《我的间隔年——潜水、花艺、搭车、义工、禅修和旅行》</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿康同学的Gap Year间隔年休学申请</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>* 如上材料可参考</span></em><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1sJOy8TmlVNYeAAg5jHPfTA" data-url="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1sJOy8TmlVNYeAAg5jHPfTA"><em><span>百度网盘</span></em></a><em><span> &nbsp;: 密码 </span></em><u><em><span>u3hp</span></em></u></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️ 感谢</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Special thanks to 高梓清 Isabella.</span></p><span></span><p><span>👂🏻 </span><strong><span>微信听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSEs15bd4sUDGXHX2hK2cHKj4A-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
